tato dhyāna ||
aiṁ (5) nīlaḥ pañcāṇano nitya (*)(?) nnarddhapajyaka saṃsthita ||
dviraṣṭha darṣade śrīyo ratnasarppāsthi caccita ||
vahniṇābhi sthitāmbhoje kṛtāṃguṣṭheti bhairava ||
kattārālānta vyāghrā śukrāñcī kaṭistu hāsyavān ||
vibhṛchūlacakaṃ dhvajā dānañca dakṣabāhubhi ||
pārijāta jāpyamālā pustakā bhayakaṅkarai ||
anyadbāhudvayābhyāñca kacarmmavṛta vigrahaṃ ||
devāvṛta śmaśāne ca sadeva saṃsthito nava ||
prasaṅgādastragrāmānāṃ athātahaṃ krammādbhruve ||
śūlān sarvva tat jvālāt ścakratmāyākṣayo bhavata ||
dhvajāpālokamāmi tvaṃ dānān sarvvajñatā bhavet ||
lakṣmīlābhaḥ pārījāte | mantrasiddhistu jāpyake ||
jāvan sarvvajñatā puste tvataye nirbhaya tvaka ||
antarāya tirodhānaṃ sambhavedbrarhmarcarmmani ||

<p. 23b> mūktevalalito devo lakṣmī sthulaḥ pranasyate ||
śeṣakāryāye deveśo jathābhimatasarmmata ||
pītavarṇṇabheven stambhe vaśye kukuma sannibha ||
uccāte dhurmmavarṇṇābho vidveṣe sainvavachavi ||
mohaṇe jatravajñeyo maśivaśaṃsane mata ||
indranilaṇibhaḥ sarvva krarmmaṇye vana viśvaraṃ ||
śitaḥ śyatā muktipathe śuddhasphatika sannibhaṃ ||
raktagaura śriye proktaṃ padmavarṇṇasukṣobhake ||
ciṃtayet parameśānaṃ nāvakaṃ varggasādhano ||
śāmnāvṛṣabhaskatvasthaṃ padmārūḍhaṃ tu pauṣṭike ||
uccātte karabhārūḍhaṃ mohane dvipi vāhana ||
meṣārūḍhaṃ jayeddevaṃ mukameva ca karmmani ||
sainyastambhaiṇa veśānaṃ khajagaṃ rasmisaṃnibhaṃ ||
tīkṣṇatīkṣṇabharaṃ kārya mṛddhodhaṇamimītuye || 
sthirorāryañca vidyā ca siṃhāsanagataṃ jayet ||

<p. 24a> nīlāñjaṇasamaprakhyā kubjirūpā mahodarā ||
ṣaṭvaktā dvādaśabhujā sapyāsthi ratnacarccītā ||
muṇḍamālādharī raundrī draṣṭākarālikā ṇanā || 
aṣṭādaśāmbakāṃ devī varvvarorddhaśirorūhā ||
vyāghracarmmaparīdhānā śiṃha camottariyakāṃ ||
divyābharaṇabhūṣāṅga attahāsātmya hāsinī ||
tasyā pītaṃ jalaṃ vaktra uttarasyāmasanibhaḥ ||
dakṣiṇe kṛṣṇavarṇṇañca jansaṃmukhatpadaśite ||
pūrvvavaktraṃ bhavedraktraṃ mīsajaṃ sphutikopamaḥ ||
sahasrasūryasaṃkāsaṃmurddhavaktra parāccite ||
caurakūpe ca vāme ca dakṣakarṇṇa śrutiṣvapi ||
nāsāgravilaculi ca taleṣapī krarmmātmaka ||
śilācitradārūlepagataṃ vaktravavimyahaṃ ||
jalasaumyañca vāmāṅga pūrvva ca dakṣakarṇṇage ||
parāvaktramūddhadeśe tat mastake parābhidha ||
sarvvadaṃṣṭākarālāni vaktrānyaktāni śambhunā ||

<p. 24b> astrāṇyasyā pravakhyāmi kubjikāyāṃ mahānticā ||
dakṣiṇe ca prayogeṇa vāme caiva vrijāṇata ||
triśulacakravajāṇi aṃkuśaḥ śarakarttike ||
dakṣiṇe vāmato dadyāt nilotpalaṃ satārakaṃ ||
anyañca muṇḍakhaṭvāṅga ghaṇṭhāpustadhanustathā ||
kapālaṃ vāmake proktraṃ siṃhāsana śavāsanā ||
tatvāprāpti bhavai śūlāccakrānmāyakṣayo bhavet ||
vajjān sarvvarogaṇāśca ścākuśāt karṣaṇatmataṃ ||
śarāchakra viṇāśaṃśca karttito vighnavajjanaṃ ||
lakṣmīlābha utpale ca khaṭvāṅgādaṣṭasiddhaye ||
yāvanmantrārthavarttitya ghaṇṭhātaḥ saprajāyate ||
jāvachāstrātha vādhatva pustācāpārthato caśa ||
krapālācca mahāsiddhi rastrānāñca mahāmate ||
brahmapādatale tasyā jaghane viṣṇurucyate ||

<p. 25a> hṛdaye vasate rodraṃ īśvaraḥ kaṇṭhamaṇḍale ||
śadāśivo lalāṭesyā || śivastasyoparisthitaṃ ||
candrākkīganayomantre satārā ṛkṣamaṇḍalaṃ ||
svarggamaṣṭavidhaṃ padme pretasyoparikalpayet ||
svādhiṣṭhāṇe dharātatva toyaṇābhau vicintayet ||
tejo hṛdaye madhye tu vāyukaṇṭhe prakalpayet ||
ākāsantu lalāte ca teṣu sarvve vyavasthitāḥ ||
kulikoti śahasrāni ārūḍhaḥ kulasāsane ||
tasyā piṇḍa vicāresu devānāmapi dullabhaḥ ||
aṇantapādayostasyā ṇupuraṃ parikīrttitaṃ ||
kakkoto meṣalāvarddhe katibandhuḥ prakīrttita ||
takṣakamupavitantu gale hārastu vāśuki ||
kulikaṃ karṇṇayoḥ proktaḥ kurmmakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ ||
bhūmadhye saṃsthitaḥ padmo mahāpadmastathaiva ca ||
bāhudaṇḍeṣu sarvveṣu śahasraphanīmaṇḍitaṃ ||

<p. 25b> taḍikoti sahasrābhaṃ jvalāmālā samākulaḥ ||
iti dakaśrīkubjikālakṣmī mātapūrṇṇakadviciṃtayat ||
iti krarmmadhyāna ||

