sarvvapāpavinirmuktaṃ sarvvakāmaphalapradaṃ ||
putra pautra dhanaṃ dhānyaṃ lakṣmīñcāpi pravarddhatu ||
yāvat tadvastrataṃtunāṃ tāvadvarṣasahasrakaṃ ||
yā dadyātma vaseddevī pure bhogaiḥ samanvite ||
dakṣiṇādi catuḥ ṣaṭvādramyaṃ ca guruve dadet ||
yajamānā na dadyācca yadi ceṣṭā nirarthakaṃ || (*)(?) ||
dhaukhitaṃ priti kāmanārthena upadoṣayāmi ||

<p. 54b> tathāstu ||
thvate vidhi || vitāna upadohanārthaṃ || dhvajapatākā upadohanāthaṃ ||
rūpya śṛṃkharīmālā upadohanārthaṃ || śubha ||


